  "slug": "lighter-basil-pesto",
  "name": "Lighter Basil Pesto",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "This low calorie pesto recipe has ricotta cheese adding thickness to this lighter version of pesto sauce that's full of the traditional basil flavor.",
  "cuisine": "Italian Inspired Italian",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Chop basil, garlic, and pine nuts in a food processor. Add ricotta cheese to basil mixture and process. Repeat with Parmesan cheese, olive oil, salt, and black pepper. Add vegetable broth and process until sauce is smooth. Add more broth if pesto is too thick."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 8,
